 "solution": "Area $= \\dfrac12|(1 - 4) + (-4 - 1) + (y + 2x) + (2x - y)| = \\dfrac12|4x - 8|$\n\n$9 = \\dfrac12|4x - 8| \\Rightarrow (2x - 4)^2 = 81 \\Rightarrow 4x^2 - 16x - 65 = 0$",
